│                                                                                                                            │
│   Help: Backup & Restore                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                            │
│  Create snapshots of biggz-ai state and restore them later. Backups include skills, configuration, and persistent memory.  │
│                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                            │
│  Keyboard Shortcuts                                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                            │
│    ENTER  — Create or restore a backup                                                                                     │
│    ↑↓  — Select backup entry                                                                                               │
│    R  — Refresh backup list                                                                                                │
│    ESC  — Back to main menu                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                            │
│  Press ? or ESC to close help                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                            │
